  {
    "id": 2006008010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "この通り、ピッタリだよ\r\nどうだい？　この衣装は",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、よく似合ってるよ\r\nさすが咲耶、上手く着こなしてるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタにそう言ってもらえてよかったよ、フフ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、なんだか楽しそうだな\r\nよっぽどその衣装が気に入ったのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、気付かれてしまったかい？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010040",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……そうだね。きっと、この衣装のおかげかな",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "鏡の前に立った瞬間、\r\nそこにいるのが自分じゃないような錯覚に陥ったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私ではない、違う私を見ている……\r\nそんな気がするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "モデルの時だって、\r\n色んな衣装を着ていたんじゃないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もちろん、モデルとして様々な衣装に\r\n袖を通すのは楽しかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "スポーティーな私、エレガントな私……\r\n色々な自分に変身できたからね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど……\r\nこの衣装は、少し特別なんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに……\r\nモデル仕事で着る服とは少し、違うかもしれないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、もうわかってるじゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "この衣装を着ていると、なんだか……\r\n違う世界の住人になったかのような気持ちになれるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタがプロデュースする、アンティーカの世界……\r\n……アナタが生み出した世界の、ね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n咲耶らしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アナタの生み出した世界で\r\n私はどんなふうに生きているのだろう",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "恋鐘、摩美々、結華、霧子も……きっとそれぞれが、\r\nアナタの世界で『自分らしく』生きているはずだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、きっとそうだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そして……その世界で、\r\n私はどのようにアナタと出会うのだろうね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、俺も居るのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もちろん。私たちの世界の生みの親だからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600801/2006008010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008010170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私とアナタはどんな世界でも出会えるはずだと、\r\nそう私は信じているよ",
